    {
      "key": "Handler/TutorialIntro",
      "label": "Configuration introduction",
      "text": "I know you must be confused, but don't worry. I will help you. My name is Happy, and I'm an experimental AI installed in your brain. Your body was nearly destroyed from the last mission, but I helped you to regain the control over your body. You'll be able to do things that used to be impossible for humans. Please take a moment to inspect your new body's configuration page, and click on Add Rule.",
      "locked": false,
      "transcribed": true
    },
    {
      "key": "Handler/TutorialGoodbye",
      "label": "Configuration farewell",
      "text": "Unfortunately, I don't have time to explain the system to you because I need to finish the Alpha Feasibility Pitch right now. Good luck figuring out the body configuration system. Bye.",
      "locked": false,
      "transcribed": true
    },
